#base robot_giant.pop
#base robot_standard.pop

// mission made by ptyx:  https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198443380789/
// a solo giga project of mine as of 04.04.25 I have poured over 1500 hours into this, with over 10 months of work and a total of 50k lines of code, most of which didnt make it this far...
// If you see this, you do not have permission to copy/use any of the templates, logic or sound assets contained in this mission. This will be a subject to change after this mission releases

// Baron Of Hell (both variants),and marauder models - property of bethesda, port by me, you cannot use these ports in your mission(s), however you are free to port it yourself!
// Kmlp - helped alot with the general concepts used in this mission as well as made some of the sound related functions, the melee punch base for the baron of hell as well as helped with troubleshooting
// all the epic potato people who helped me resolve problems I encountered while making this
// special thanks to ocet247 (https://steamcommunity.com/id/ocet247/) for their help with the obscure aspects of VScript no one else seemed to know about
// Mikroscopic - creator of kelly, allowed me to modify the map so we could get custom particles and better map transformation!
// Sgt Table - took the dynamic timer concept from echoes :D
// Snurper_Bob - made banger intro music
// Braindawg - is responsible for the logic behind the bfg tendrills
// Bazooks - helped alot of with development of this mission 


WaveSchedule
{
	StartingCurrency	800
	FixedRespawnWaveTime Yes
	CanBotsAttackWhileInSpawnRoom	no
	RespawnWaveTime	4
	EventPopfile Halloween

	SniperHideLasers 1
	//ReverseWinConditions 1 				 				 
	BluHumanInfiniteAmmo 0 		
	BluPlayersAreRobots 0			 
	FlagCarrierMovementPenalty 0.5		 
	AllowJoinTeamBlue 0
	AllowJoinTeamBlueMax 0
	MaxRedPlayers 6
	BluHumanInfiniteCloak 0
	RespawnWaveTimeBlue 5			 		 

	ForceRedMoney 1
	SetCreditTeam 2
	MaxSpectators 6
	NoReanimators 1
	NoRomevisionCosmetics 1
	NoBluHumanFootsteps 1
	ZombiesNoWave666 1
	ImprovedAirblast 1
	MaxRedPlayers 6
